{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0484_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a872af26bc7baf94b3484959edef015fe11de4f31555daac39cc694044437271", "ja": "（今後の撮影に向けて、千早の新しい衣装を\n準備した。雰囲気のあるドレスで、よく似合っている）", "zh": "（为了之后的拍摄，准备了千早的新服装。\n是一条很有氛围感的裙子，她穿起来很合适。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0484_1001_002chi", "source_sha256": "8e3d0afe44327efc2f7cef3f824aa90b2f64e6e846a91607d719a798baced82a", "ja": "そうですね……。本当にいい感じだと思います。\n歌の世界観を、上手く引き立ててくれそうな。", "zh": "是啊……我觉得真的很不错。\n感觉能很好地衬托出歌曲的世界观。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0484_1002_002chi", "source_sha256": "fbd41c16988d66bef25b73daac52119c31862b599d881def95ca66cde9b8c487", "ja": "綺麗で、幻想的だからでしょうか？\n袖を通すと、程よい緊張感をもらえますね。", "zh": "是因为它既美丽又梦幻吗？\n穿上它之后，也会让人感到恰到好处的紧张感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0484_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a9b3a33df6d93685b15fa6091ccda8ab3fa8c673b1ad9bca91ec748af43305e8", "ja": "そうか！　そう言ってもらえて安心したよ。\nかなりこだわって作ってもらったからな。", "zh": "这样啊！听你这么说我就放心了。毕竟这套服装可是让他们花了不少心思做的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0484_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "325ed2183f70a348db10853bf24b73c0d0cb35719fc0acc536b6875e55b4dfd4", "ja": "ええ。衣装をいただいた時、すぐにわかりました。\nいつも、心配はしていないのですが。", "zh": "嗯。拿到服装的时候，我马上就明白了。\n我一直都没有担心过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0484_1005_002chi", "source_sha256": "9e106ab93bdc2b1b6d50a4096ddf2d48096aa70eaad3ad3105f62763900e46f6", "ja": "{$P$}は、必ず\n私に合わせたものを用意してくれますから。", "zh": "{$P$}每次都会\n准备适合我的服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0484_1006_002chi", "source_sha256": "0e4e3d2cb1fe22434dea889731ad3cecadf1ca02784a3d39ad4d0aa5adb773f8", "ja": "今回の衣装も、歌にしっかり集中できそうです。", "zh": "这次的服装似乎也能让我好好专注于歌唱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0484_1007_p", "source_sha256": "b3d3074eee8822cbf47a5acb690dea3a5255a22d7b0818428d46c19b03e36d0c", "ja": "よかった。見た目ももちろん大切だけど、\n本人が気に入ってくれることが一番だから。", "zh": "太好了。外观固然重要，\n不过本人能够喜欢才是最重要的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0484_1008_p", "source_sha256": "694fd4050e4829c8105f6a706b14dec7d84af0718eca32324c90dc35bbc072aa", "ja": "千早のためになったのならなによりだ。\n早くみんなに披露したいな。", "zh": "如果能帮到千早就再好不过了。\n真想早点展示给大家看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0484_1009_002chi", "source_sha256": "97acd1816415f2d8767303771621b7301349e30a1456bd58b0458028c0fcbc1b", "ja": "はい。歌そのものはもちろんですが、皆さんには\n衣装も含めたパフォーマンスを楽しんでほしいですね。", "zh": "是的。歌曲本身自不必说，我也希望大家能欣赏包括服装在内的整体表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0484_1010_002chi", "source_sha256": "f102cbd0ce6e368bde01d52867a5891500b1c6ad174ffbfb67d2fec280e3742f", "ja": "私自身、いただいた衣装の魅力を引き出せるよう、\nしっかりレッスンを重ねていこうと思います。", "zh": "为了能够展现出这套服装的魅力，我也会认真地不断练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0484_1011_p", "source_sha256": "73688337ee44ffcbf2fd2d5ff508ee239fed3f056e40dc7386a6b8f73100623c", "ja": "それについては、\nこっちもあまり心配していないけど……。", "zh": "关于那件事，我这边倒也不是很担心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0484_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "b3187a8a3a5774d65db5ac6ed25bf761caf482691e2ceedc9128af64e68d01da", "ja": "いえ。その時の調子もありますし、油断はできません。", "zh": "不是。状态也会受到当时情况的影响，不能掉以轻心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0484_1013_002chi", "source_sha256": "a66751df5a079ad4568718f8db3ce6809eaf062ea20c8654b8d5085782fd7f16", "ja": "相手の信頼に甘えるのではなく、\n信頼されているからこそ、常に全力で挑んでいきます。", "zh": "我不会依赖对手的信任，正因为受到信任，才更要始终全力以赴地迎接挑战。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0484_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2efbef3a21a5b54884e3e1a3497e3052f2ead59e4741373b94ef655176a78eb8", "ja": "そうか、千早の言うとおりだよな。\nそれなら自分も、これからもベストを尽くすよ。", "zh": "这样啊，确实如千早所说。\n既然如此，我今后也会继续竭尽全力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0484_1015_002chi", "source_sha256": "fa9abd605c3de62b68699857a5fa0107280614f8469cdd37f29751fb470211b0", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　まずは私がこの衣装を\n披露する時を楽しみにしていてください。", "zh": "谢谢！先请期待我穿着这套服装登台亮相的那一刻吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0484_1016_p", "source_sha256": "88fbfa2d6f334a22ccb7a738ffaaa3e282865b3ada243cd1f28840d2240cba83", "ja": "ああ、こちらこそありがとう。頼んだぞ！", "zh": "啊，我才要谢谢你。拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0484_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5efddc91cbe4e7b3cd0ba94bf22cbe02258b988f8a56315db24ed73789bb3c8f", "ja": "（千早が物事に向き合う姿勢はいつだって真摯だ。\nその羽ばたきを、これからも支えていかないとな）", "zh": "（千早面对事物时的态度一直都很认真。\n今后也得继续支持她展翅高飞才行）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
